TI  - Preserving Muscle Health During Weight Loss: Evidence Across Lifestyle, Surgical, and Pharmacological Interventions.
AU  - Iwanicka Aleksandra
AU  - Olesinski Maksymilian
AU  - Skrobarczyk Adam
AU  - Sosniak Izabella
AU  - Drewniak Zuzanna
AU  - Rzasa Marta
