TI  - Combined time-restricted feeding and resistance training enhance tirzepatide-induced improvements in adiposity and whole-body insulin sensitivity in female mice.
AU  - Macêdo Ana Paula Azevêdo
AU  - da Conceição de Mattis Luciana Renata
AU  - de Lima Robson Damasceno
