ID  - 42097279
TI  - Gut microbiota responses to isocaloric macronutrient modulation in tissue-specific insulin resistance: a secondary analysis of the PERSonalized glucose Optimization through Nutritional intervention (PERSON) randomized trial.
AU  - Jardon Kelly M
AU  - Umanets Alexander
AU  - Venema Koen
AU  - Trouwborst Inez
AU  - Gijbels Anouk
AU  - Hul Gabby B
AU  - Siebelink Els
